    "228021 Mist Infusion has a missile model1513527 and world nearby-entry condition114537 (raid Helya), not a procedural chain.228854 triggers raid effects. Do not replace that shared raid condition with115133 to force a candidate.",
    "195062 is the blue Warswords empowerment chain;211670 describes binding the Skull of the Manari. Neither is established as the Rockaway ritual beam."
